<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Niagara Mohawk downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Niagara Mohawk downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal and Co said it downgraded its rating on Niagara Mohawk Power Corp to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Citing the company's statement that it was delaying its preferred dividend, the firm said there was &quot;increased uncertainty now facing the company.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Niagara Mohawk was off 5/8 to 9-7/8</p>
